---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Affiliate disclosure"
  description="How this site earns money and how it affects (and does not affect) our reviews."
  path="/disclosure/"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Affiliate disclosure</h1>
    <div class="content-body mt-6">
      <h2>Amazon and affiliate networks</h2>
      <p>
        We earn commissions on qualifying purchases made through links on this site. Some of those links are Amazon
        Associates links; others are provided by affiliate networks and advertising partners that track the click and
        pay us a share of any resulting sale. In every case the commission is paid by the retailer, at no additional
        cost to you. Amazon and the Amazon logo are trademarks of Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates.
      </p>
      <h2>Other affiliate programs</h2>
      <p>
        We also participate in selected brand-operated affiliate programs. Where a page contains affiliate links, the
        disclosure appears near the top of the page. Affiliate links are marked with <code>rel="sponsored"</code>.
      </p>
      <h2>What commissions do not buy</h2>
      <p>
        Commissions never buy scores, rankings, placement or a positive conclusion. Products are not accepted for review
        on the condition of a favourable rating, and negative findings are published whenever the evidence supports them.
      </p>
      <h2>Prices</h2>
      <p>
        Prices shown on this site are captured automatically and labelled with the date they were captured. The final
        price is the one shown on the retailer's site at checkout. Prices and availability can change at any time.
      </p>
      <h2>Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        This site may display advertising. Advertisers have no influence over editorial content.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
